WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.825
Array of sprites of kind enemy is a list of every enemy right now.

2
00:00:05.925 --> 00:00:10.350
A for element loop runs its blocks once for each item in the list.

3
00:00:12.905 --> 00:00:16.605
Each time round, value stands for the next alien.

4
00:00:17.208 --> 00:00:21.858
So one press reaches every alien, even though none of them has a name.
